mobile apps, SaaS products, dashboards and admin tools — screens that dispatchers, drivers and project teams use to get their work done."}],["$","p","Since 2020 I have worked on one ride-hailing and logistics ecosystem: passenger apps, driver apps, dispatcher CRM, reporting dashboards and admin workflows. I start with the flows and the information architecture, together with the developers, and only then draw the high-fidelity UI.",{"children":"Since 2020 I have worked on one ride-hailing and logistics ecosystem: passenger apps, driver apps, dispatcher CRM, reporting dashboards and admin workflows. I start with the flows and the information architecture, together with the developers, and only then draw the high-fidelity UI."}],["$","p","I also use OpenAI Codex and Claude Code to take designs into code: landing pages, product-site prototypes and admin concepts. I review the HTML, CSS and JavaScript they produce and write instructions developers can build from.",{"children":"I also use OpenAI Codex and Claude Code to take designs into code: landing pages, product-site prototypes and admin concepts. I review the HTML, CSS and JavaScript they produce and write instructions developers can build from."}]]}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"meta-row profile-intro__facts","children":[["$","div","Based in",{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Based in"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Kyiv, Ukraine"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"aria-labelledby":"strengths-heading","className":"profile-section","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"profile-section__head","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Strengths"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"strengths-heading","children":"What I am reliably good at"}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"strength-list","children":[["$","li","Tools for dispatch and logistics teams",{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"strength-list__context","children":"Ride-hailing and logistics"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Tools for dispatch and logistics teams"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Dispatcher CRM, reporting dashboards and admin workflows in one ride-hailing and logistics ecosystem. I also led the redesign of a car-sharing and ride-hailing platform."}]]}],"$L23","$L24","$L25"]}]]}],"$L26","$L27","$L28",null]}]],"$L29"]
23:["$","li","Patterns that keep several products looking like one",{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"strength-list__context","children":"Interface systems"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Patterns that keep several products looking like one"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Figma components and interface patterns that new work can pick up, so consistency holds across platforms and the next project does not start from a blank file."}]]}]
